<title>SWEDEN: AssiDoman sells saw mill to Geijertra.</title>
<headline>AssiDoman sells saw mill to Geijertra.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company AssiDoman said on Monday it was selling its Orrefors saw mill to Geijertra AB.</p>
<p>The saw mill has a capacity of 45,000 cubic metres and 20 employees who will continue working at the mill under the new owner.</p>
<p>AssiDoman said in a statement that the sale would take effect from April 1.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
